<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-COLOGNE EXTEND NEURURER'S CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLOGNE EXTEND NEURURER'S CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German first division side Cologne said on Wednesday they were extending trainer Peter Neururer's contract until June 1998.</p>
<p>Neururer was widely credited with saving Cologne from relegation last season after joining the club in April, just before the season ended. At the winter break this season they lie in seventh and are pushing for a place in the UEFA Cup.</p>
</text>
